# Clips keep playing while Macros owns the screen. Stop while away, then
# Purpose: keep Clips playing while Macros owns the screen. Stop while away, then
# return: the retained matrix must show current transport state, not a stale head.
# Expect: capture_match:stopped_return=stopped_later
# Expect: capture_changed:playing=stopped_return
# Expect: semantic:macro_view:mode=macro.performance
# Expect: semantic:stopped_return:mode=sequencer.clip_launcher
0 scenario clip-launcher-v3
100 capture screen initial
200 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
300 tap NAV 60
2000 capture screen playing
2200 button LEFT_TOP down
2400 encoder NAV -0.01
2600 button LEFT_TOP up
3000 capture screen macro_view
6000 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
6300 button LEFT_TOP down
6500 encoder NAV 0.01
6700 button LEFT_TOP up
7100 capture screen stopped_return
7500 capture screen stopped_later
